zFy4rnT2NnIibfpqRu8%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T13:25:38.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxOTM1MDQ1NA%3D%3D:2451190006:1","title":"一场专挑iPhone下手的恶意广告行动","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxOTM1MDQ1NA==&mid=2451190006&idx=1&sn=83db193b27264e4becfc1408c81f0822&chksm=8d3f86639c5aa53d174498e52cd9d711f631e174cb34393071a8801ff4695bf500d2f1dc2706&scene=126&sessionid=1795484930#rd","description":"2026年11月，Confiant披露了一个名为MoldyRoost的大规模malvertising（恶意广告","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FibO9kiauylaDomVkVPIqkaVHuCja96HtH3yhpMA6zwBtKtH7NaYgboxfYACZ3MYfBr3iau4Qic8icpA8snoo1jEqqFD6U8HP99ajh9AZJjMHeLsU%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-21T15:23:11.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxOTM1MDQ1NA%3D%3D:2451189987:1","title":"科学家用引力穿过墙壁传出一条消息","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxOTM1MDQ1NA==&mid=2451189987&idx=1&sn=7c5dde8a42f9a555963ad6183dc115b8&chksm=8db7e35aceed7074f0976582331f89af815e2ccf7be19410a57c0b526372a2d53a85a3ec48a6&scene=126&sessionid=1795484930#rd","description":"设想一间完全屏蔽的房间，光、声音、粒子和热量都进不来也出不去，人被关在里面，手机信号被金属壁挡住，他还能把消息","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FibO9kiauylaDqliaDa5QmBNgbnib5LYVcPicnyX24I2mPHXmElxib3o4g7DKAuQs03arpwSNLA65OYGlzUXx7iaLuNRaPZGVKJh9bngTwZSbdXFhl0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T15:26:23.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxOTM1MDQ1NA%3D%3D:2451189947:1","title":"1500 万份文件背后德意志银行的合规暗面","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxOTM1MDQ1NA==&mid=2451189947&idx=1&sn=d16028173bdcfab77fd0ea496ed48303&chksm=8da59b518a369497a84aa5d925db82f2e7c6ff4e8761ff4c7682cb5dbcc4ccb862dff960973a&scene=126&sessionid=1795484930#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FibO9kiauylaDqxSbbP5fbZRjTaWicb7icvDqYzXHap8icMxpl9ffx55ibKtbOVm1yicic4xfJ1jGUWWKD6zI8yxR3B1g0EjNlwCOia3N4Zq